12	// The sheet's today: shown, and changeable. It starts as the real date. A steward archives the sheet here too;
13	// and clones it to another, never used, id; all share the sheet's error, and each action clears the others'. The sheet's parent (from its settings) shows here.
14	function SheetToday({ sheet, user }: { sheet: string; user: string }) {
